<title>THAILAND: RESEARCH ALERT - BECL to make loss - Thaimex.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BECL to make loss - Thaimex.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>High financing costs and rising depreciation will see Thailand's Bangkok Expressway Plc post losses of 196 million baht in 1997, Thaimex Finance and Securities said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The company can expect to lose about 196 million baht in 1997, improving only slightly to a loss of 147 million baht in 1998. With this kind of outlook Thaimex must rate BECL an underperform,&quot; it said in a report.</p>
</text>
